  "body": "It seems to me that there are more than a few places where we strip username and password from a URL, then pass it to the URL serializer with the `exclude fragment` flag set. Perhaps we could simplify this by adding an `exclude credentials` flag as well?\r\n\r\nIs that a patch you'd accept, @annevk?",
